safix::no_creation_rule

  × .sops.yaml has no creation rule for secrets/safix/shared/ana,bo/
  │ secrets.yaml
  │ 
  │ The recipient policy is generated from the declarations, and a file with
  │ no rule must fail closed rather than acquire a default recipient set:
  │ there is deliberately no catch-all rule to fall back on.
  │ 
  │ Regenerate it, review the diff, then re-run:
  │ 
  │     safix fix
  │     git diff .sops.yaml
